    "turn_text": "But Scott also writes an equal measure about his confidence and what he calls his first presidential bid. That was to lead his high school student government association in 1982. He won, but he says at the time that he almost doubted whether a young black man in the South even had a chance. So I asked Senator Scott about his party today and whether he thinks we currently live in an environment where a black man could be the Republican nominee for President of the United States.",
