        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "There were race riots at my high school during my eighth grade year.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "I have fought for and achieved successful policy accomplishments within the Republican Party.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "When I became president of student government, the student body was 70% white.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
