    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "I want to talk for a moment about your experience on January 6th because you wrote about the tension and pain as you and your fellow senators took refuge in a Senate office building and the moment in which you called for Senate chaplain Barry Black to minister to the group of lawmaker and aides who were gathered. And I'm wondering if you can tell us a little bit about what it was like inside that room.",
