    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91276.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "Over the course of reading this book, the big thing that I came away with is that you're using your story and the stories of others around you and stories of people from history. to uplift a message of redemption for this country. And so is there anything in your career or in your life that you are hoping for redemption on?",
